<section class="pack-cta"><div class="pack-container"><span class="pack-kicker">LET’S GIVE YOUR NEXT IDEA A FORM.</span><div><h2>Packaging that moves<br>your thinking forward.</h2><a class="pack-button pack-button-dark" href="#contact">Request a quote <x-frontend::arrow/></a></div><span class="cta-outline" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div></section>
<section id="contact" class="pack-section pack-container pack-contact"><div class="pack-contact-copy"><span class="pack-kicker"><span>08 /</span> START WITH A CONVERSATION</span><h2>Tell us what<br>you have in mind.</h2><p>A product idea. A format to explore. A specification to work through. Start by putting the details in one place.</p><div class="pack-contact-note"><span class="pack-tiny-label">ENQUIRY FORM PREVIEW</span><p>This form prepares a requirement summary in your browser. It does not send an enquiry or store your details on a server.</p></div><div class="pack-contact-details"><span>BUSINESS CONTACT</span>@if($company['email'])<a href="mailto:{{ $company['email'] }}">{{ $company['email'] }}</a>@else<p>Verified email and telephone details<br>will be available before launch.</p>@endif @if($company['phone'])<a href="tel:{{ preg_replace('/[^+0-9]/', '', $company['phone']) }}">{{ $company['phone'] }}</a>@endif</div></div><noscript><p>The enquiry preview requires JavaScript. No details can be sent through this preview.</p></noscript><form inert :inert="false" class="pack-enquiry-form" @submit.prevent="prepareSummary($event)" x-ref="enquiry" aria-describedby="enquiry-note"><p id="enquiry-note" class="pack-form-note">Prepare your brief · Preview only, no submission</p><div class="pack-form-grid"><div><label for="full_name">Full name <span>*</span></label><input id="full_name" name="full_name" autocomplete="name" required maxlength="100" placeholder="Your full name"></div><div><label for="company_name">Company name</label><input id="company_name" name="company_name" autocomplete="organization" maxlength="150" placeholder="Your company"></div><div><label for="enquiry_email">Email address <span>*</span></label><input id="enquiry_email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required maxlength="255" placeholder="you@company.com"></div><div><label for="phone">Phone number</label><input id="phone" name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" maxlength="40" placeholder="Include country code"></div><div class="full-span"><label for="category">Product category <span>*</span></label><select id="category" name="category" x-model="category" required><option value="">Select a format to discuss</option><option value="unsure">Not sure yet — let’s explore</option><option value="custom">Other / custom requirement</option>@foreach($company['products'] as $product)<option value="{{ $product['id'] }}">{{ $product['name'] }} (concept)</option>@endforeach</select></div><div class="full-span"><label for="details">Requirement details <span>*</span></label><textarea id="details" name="details" rows="4" required minlength="15" maxlength="3000" placeholder="Tell us about your product, pack size, approximate quantity, and any special requirements."></textarea></div></div><div class="pack-form-bottom"><p>No details are transmitted.<br>Required fields are marked *.</p><button class="pack-button pack-button-orange" type="submit">Prepare requirement summary <x-frontend::arrow/></button></div><div class="pack-summary" x-show="summary" x-cloak aria-live="polite"><h3>Your brief is ready to review.</h3><p>This is a local summary. Nothing has been sent.</p><pre x-text="summary"></pre><button class="pack-text-link" type="button" @click="downloadBrief()">Download your brief (.txt) ↓</button></div></form></section>
